    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Ynnari Venom",
    "summary": "At the end of either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), if no models are embarked in this **TRANSPORT**, you may pick 1 **YNNARI INFANTRY** unit of yours that:\n\n- only has models from units named in the Transport ability of this unit\n- has no more than 6 models\n- lies wholly within 6\" of the **TRANSPORT**\n\nIf the picked unit is outside the **[Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)** of every enemy unit, it may embark in this **TRANSPORT**, even if it disembarked earlier in the turn from this **TRANSPORT**.",
